  "body": "Design decision record for #5785, following the #3455 record convention. Settles: (a) markup contexts for data values — text/quoted-attribute via html_escape, URL via sanitize_link_url, script context prohibited; (b) safe-plain as a per-client user-selected rendering mode (not a data classification), composing with the #3455 plain contract; (c) the ingest rule — stored/forwarded data is never evaluated downstream; (d) ANSI/OSC disposition — sequence-level adapter concern, Cf set not extended, with the terminal_text OSC-payload residual recorded. Includes the audit inventory of markup/terminal-emitting surfaces with file:line evidence at base 99f657e08a, and the compatibility statement against #5679 / #5849-#5855. Doc-only change. Closes #5785 on merge (the issue closes only by the landed document, per its acceptance criteria). Queue task 13266.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796733860&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7687&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7687&signature=d6ca333ff118a32d203e65ce1635a658e8346f16742475edae1b28dbb780b1b1\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7687?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer --